{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/278132-brainstorm-suggestion-request","id":278132,"title":"Brainstorm/Suggestion Request","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-11T08:06:55-07:00","id":278132,"title":"Brainstorm/Suggestion Request","content":"Come December, I'll be heading back to the States for a a couple of weeks vacation and I'm arranging for a one-shot gaming day with my old group.<br /> <br /> I presenting it at as using NWoD GMC rules to simulate an X-Com type situation, but my idea is that they're actually stuck in some Durance (I've quietly contacted one of the potential players about playing a Keeper in secret) with the idea that they'd be escaping the Hedge at the end of the game.<br /> <br /> Any particular ideas or suggestions for this idea?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","name":"Thrythlind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-11T12:21:22-07:00","id":278292,"title":"","content":"It can certainly work. My suggestion would be pretty freeform with Arcadia...use whatever systems you wish. Its up to you how to handle kiths...technically when they leave Arcadia they would have Kiths as per the book, but for purposes of that as the ending you could skip out on it without too much trouble...the reveal would be enough, I think.<br /> <br /> It could go well, certainly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"col